# PulseForge

A lightweight CLI tool for monitoring APIs and services in real time.

PulseForge continuously checks your endpoints, measures response latency, detects failures, and gives you a clear overview of service health directly from your terminal.

## Features

* Monitor multiple URLs
* HTTP status monitoring
* Response-time measurement
* Configurable check intervals
* Automatic failure detection
* Clean terminal output
* Zero external dependencies

## Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/pulseforge.git
cd pulseforge
```

Run:

```bash
python pulseforge.py
```

## Usage

```bash
python pulseforge.py https://example.com https://api.github.com
```

With a custom interval:

```bash
python pulseforge.py https://example.com --interval 10
```

