## Why PulseForge?

Traditional monitoring platforms can be unnecessarily complex for small projects and personal infrastructure.

PulseForge focuses on one thing:

**Know when your services stop responding.**

It is small enough to run anywhere, but structured so it can grow into a more advanced monitoring system.

